# #Reclamation Project - Pip-Boy bio-monitor

bio-monitor-no-access = You need a Pip-Boy, a med scanner in hand, INT 10, or the Field Medic perk to read your body like that.

trait-name-ReclamationFieldMedic = Field Medic
trait-description-ReclamationFieldMedic = You've patched yourself up enough times to know your own body. Open your bio-monitor without a Pip-Boy, and dig out bullets and shrapnel with your hands as well as with tools (deep rifle rounds still need a hemostat). You can also do surgery on yourself (lie down first). Same as having INT 10. Gen 3 synths and Coursers already have this.
bio-monitor-self-surgery-hint = You can't operate on yourself without the Field Medic perk. To dig out your own bullets, hold a hemostat, open your bio-monitor and press Remove.
bio-monitor-self-surgery-perk = You can't operate on yourself. That takes the Field Medic perk (or INT 10).
